{"seq":6,"at":"2026-10-21","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a2607"},"reason":"Proofread (reasons in the entries above / the batch report).","by":"enrich batch 210","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-enrich/enrich-report/a2603-a0485.md","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",628],["+","**Two at once.** On 18 June 1995 the American Steve Trotter, who had already survived the plunge alone in 1985, went over the Horseshoe Falls again – this time together with Lori Martin, making them the first man and woman to go over the falls together. They survived in a barrel welded together from two water-heater tanks and carrying an air supply for 90 minutes, and Trotter was promptly fined and jailed for two weeks.\n\n"],["=",12],["-","That"],["+","For"],["=",1],["+","more than 150 years after Blondin, no one walked directly over the falls. Special "],["=",2],["+","to try "],["=",10],["-","Nik Wallenda, "],["=",32],["-","he"],["+","Nik"],["=",1],["+","Wallenda "],["=",176],["+","Steve Trotter and Lori Martin | first couple in a barrel | 18 June 1995 |\n| "],["=",25]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",622],["+","zweit.** Am 18. Juni 1995 fuhr der Amerikaner Steve Trotter, der den Sturz 1985 schon allein überlebt hatte, erneut über die Horseshoe Falls – diesmal zusammen mit Lori Martin, als erstes Paar aus Mann und Frau. Beide überlebten in einem Fass, zusammengeschweißt aus zwei Warmwasserboilern und mit Luft für 90 Minuten, und Trotter erhielt prompt eine Geldstrafe und zwei Wochen Haft.\n\n**Zu "],["=",10],["-","Diese"],["+","Mehr"],["=",1],["-","Genehmigung"],["+","als"],["=",1],["+","150 Jahre nach Blondin lief niemand direkt über die Fälle. Eine Sondergenehmigung dafür "],["=",4],["-","Nik"],["+","ein"],["=",1],["-","Wallenda,"],["+","Artist,"],["=",33],["-","er"],["+","Nik"],["=",1],["+","Wallenda "],["=",164],["+","Steve Trotter und Lori Martin | erstes Paar im Fass | 18. Juni 1995 |\n| "],["=",23]]}],"hash":"a0a25750a6a9"},
